{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S01、S05等短停留段的感受词堆叠偏密，扫读效率不如X，部分细节容易互相争夺注意力。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用加亮关键词把每段心理变化的落点标了出来，又把人物的动机、犹豫和情绪转折拆得更清楚，尤其S06、S07、S11、S13，保留了X压缩后容易丢失的心理层次。它的音乐感受也更有过程感，能看到情绪如何随乐句推进、转折和回落，而不只是得到几个概括性的印象。X确实更利落、更容易快速扫读，但整体上牺牲了一部分人物动机和感受的细腻度，因此我选Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d9c8b4b8-ba3a-498e-b1de-31ff8a693290", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T164539228636Z", "elapsed_seconds": 138.781, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T16:47:58.029417+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "cac924d5bf2dccc33487f1bf67c4dea1c242ce38c7de4d6104f6178687907907", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py"